      "content": "We are reconciling the lockside worksheet at the east lock. The focal entry concerns one incoming parcel, and the rotation steward has asked us to apply a deterministic rule. Resolve the requested alias by following each recorded reference until an output is reached. outcome:0 means Riverstone; outcome:1 means Sunbeam. The fixed register says kit refers to reed directory; stone cabinet resolves to outcome:0; clay cabinet resolves to outcome:1. Read the mapping literally and retain the exact capitalization of the two possible ledger words. The first unrelated thread concerns canvas-cover inventory: its count was copied from yesterday and will be checked separately. That inventory neither changes a predicate nor selects a classification label.",
